sliced chicken in a bowl. Drizzle with enough olive oil to coat. Sprinkle with salt, pepper and a nice amount of fresh chopped parsley. Let sit for 20 minutes.<\\/li><li>Fire up the grill and cook the chicken for about 4 minutes per side, depending on the thickness. Set aside.<\\/li><li>Dice the avocado and toss with lime juice to coat and sprinkle with a little salt.<\\/li><li>Cook the brown rice according to package instructions.<\\/li><li>To build the bowls, start with a base of the cooked brown rice. <\\/li><li>On top of that sprinkle on some corn, drained canned black beans, and diced tomato.<\\/li><li>Once the chicken has rested a few minutes, slice on an angle. Lay the chicken on top of the bowl.<\\/li><li>Add a big spoonful of the avocado on top of the chicken. <\\/li><li>Add as much store bought salsa on top as you\'d like and finish with a big squeeze of lime juice.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"analyzedInstructions\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"steps\":[{\"number\":1,\"step\":\"Place the thinly sliced chicken in a bowl.\",\"ingredients\":[{\"id\":0,\"name\":\"chicken\",\"localizedName\":\"chicken\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/spoonacular.com\\/cdn\\/ingredients_100x100\\/whole-chicken.jpg\"}],\"equipment\":[{\"id\":404783,\"name\":\"bowl\",\"localizedName\":\"bowl\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/spoonacular.com\\/cdn\\/equipment_100x100\\/bowl.jpg\"}]},{\"number\":2,\"step\":\"Drizzle with enough olive oil to coat.\",\"ingredients\":[{\"id\":4053,\"name\":\"olive oil\",\"localizedName\":\"olive oil\",\"image\":\"olive-oil.jpg\"}],\"equipment\":[]},{\"number\":3,\"step\":\"Sprinkle with salt, pepper and a nice amount of fresh chopped parsley.\",\"ingredients\":[{\"id\":11297,\"name\":\"parsley\",\"localizedName\":\"parsley\",\"image\":\"parsley.jpg\"},{\"id\":1002030,\"name\":\"pepper\",\"localizedName\":\"pepper\",\"image\":\"pepper.jpg\"},{\"id\":2047,\"name\":\"salt\",\"localizedName\":\"salt\",\"image\":\"salt.jpg\"}],\"equipment\":[]},{\"number\":4,\"step\":\"Let sit for 20 minutes.